This directory contains various utilities for use with REND386.

They all produce PLG files.

ogre41.zip is David Boeren's excellent script-based utility for creating
           PLG files from higher-level object descriptions.  Definitely
           worth getting.  Also creates Sense8 "NFF" files.

np-demo.zip is David Boeren's wireframe PLG viewer

formla.zip is Mark T. Pflaging's program for producing three-dimensional
           graphs from equations

plgstars.zip is Bernie Roehl's simple 3D star field generator

iegeom.zip is Jerry Isdale's IEGEOM package.

prism.zip is Chris Hand's multi-sided column generator (does fluted columns
          as well)

mountain.zip is Michael Snoswell's mountain range generator

checker.exe is Todd Porter's checkerboard generator

globe.zip is Kevin Perry's sphere generator

mobius.zip is John Bell's mobius strip generator

soccer.zip is John Bell's soccer ball generator

